hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16020","Abu Salamah al-Khuzai narrated to us, Bakr ibn Mudar narrated to us, he said, Musa ibn Jubayr narrated to me, from Abu Umamah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf, from Asim ibn Umar, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) divorced Hafsah bint Umar ibn al-Khattab, then he took her back."
